[32m +Instead of hardcoding credentials, create a `.env` file and use `process.env` in `index.js`. Add `.env` to `.gitignore`.[m
[32m +[m
[32m +Example `.env`:[m
[32m +[m
[32m +```[m
[32m +DB_HOST=localhost[m
[32m +DB_USER=root[m
